graph LR
    MLMD["ml-metadata<br/>metadata_store_server"]

    %% Runtime external dependencies
    MLMD -->|primary persistence, MySQL wire| MySQL["MySQL / MariaDB server"]
    MLMD -.->|alternative persistence| PG["PostgreSQL server"]

    %% Build-time (statically linked) dependencies
    MLMD -->|server framework| GRPC["gRPC C++ v1.58.3"]
    MLMD -->|TLS, static| BoringSSL["BoringSSL 648cbaf<br/>non-FIPS-validated"]
    MLMD -->|MySQL client| MariaDBConn["MariaDB Connector/C"]
    MLMD -->|PostgreSQL client, no SSL| Libpq["libpq 12.17"]
    MLMD -->|embedded / fake backend| SQLite["SQLite 3.47.2"]
    MLMD -->|core libs, query parsing| Core["abseil, protobuf, upb, zlib 1.3.1<br/>glog, gflags, re2, ZetaSQL"]
    MLMD -->|build tool| Bazel["Bazel 6.3.2"]

    %% Internal platform
    DSPO["data-science-pipelines-operator"] -->|deploys image, supplies DB flags| MLMD
    DSP["data-science-pipelines<br/>driver / launcher / API server / UI"] -->|gRPC 8080| MLMD
    DSPADB["DSPA MariaDB"] -.->|same as MySQL backend| MySQL
    Konflux["konflux-central"] -->|Tekton PipelineRuns| MLMD

    %% Client-only (not shipped)
    PyClient["ml_metadata Python client<br/>grpcio, protobuf below 4, absl-py"] -.->|not shipped| MLMD

